# Classics Online.

**Authors:** Clayman, Dee L.

## Abstract
Appraises several databases devoted to classical literature. Thesaurus Linguae Graecae (TLG) contains the entire extant corpus of ancient Greek literature, including works on lexicography and historiography, extending into the 15th century. Other works awaiting completion are the Database of Classical Bibliography and a CD-ROM pictorial dictionary of classical mythology. (MJP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ523736

